      "review_description": "I had been considering Solar for some time. RAC sent me an e-mail outlining Members discounts including Solar with Termico. I rang for a quote and Sarah from Termico arranged for a Sales Rep to attend. Steve came on time and  I was very impressed with the quote and went ahead with Termico.From my initial call to Sarah, who was very courteous and pleasant,  through to install everything went very smooth. Installers Chris and Zac were very efficient and courteous. Their work was very neat and they took care with my roof tiles  and guttering to avoid any damage. They left the site clean and explained the working of the system clearly.I was also impressed with Steve who came to my house to provide the quote. He made sure that the system he recommended was sufficient for our past and future usage. He was very knowledgeable and courteous.I repeat my comments above and would add that I have checked with other people I know who have had Solar installed and  confirm my Termico solar was excellent value for money.",
