      "review_description": "I wish I'd asked more questions about buy back.  Since installation I've been told all solar generated goes to Atlinta and then get credit on that amount, which is deducted from my account at 8 cents per kW.  I was under the impression if I used electrical appliances whilst the sun was shining I was using solar and then it clicked over to buy back when I wasn't using it.  It would seem I now pay approx 16 cents per kW for all my electricity until I've used up my credits instead of getting the sunny days free.  Maybe it will take longer to pay off than I anticipated !!!  But still not quite sure how it works.",
